{"blocks":[{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/06/01/7792998/0002.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"はーい。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"この前の乃木ろまナレ撮りに続き、今日はロケしてきました＼(^O^)／"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"イメージカットを撮りましょうみたいな事したのね。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"初めてじゃけどんな感じになるんかなーって不安だったけど"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"皆さんに支えられて、無事やりきりました!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"一緒に頑張ったメンバーのみんなー、お疲れさまです♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ナレーションは褒めていただきました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"んーぜひオンエア楽しみにしとってくださいね(*^^*)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/06/01/7792998/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ひめたんは、憧れの人っているの〜?"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/06/01/7792998/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"日芽香ちゃんの憧れの人は誰なんですか?"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"質問・アンケートありがとーう"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"なんか、素敵なエピソードいっぱい出てきて、ほっこりした(*^^*)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"うん。そうほっこり。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"考え方はいろいろだと思いますが、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ひめたんは、目標があるから頑張れる!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"え?"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ひめたんの憧れの人が誰か聞きたーいって(o>ω<o)?"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そうだねー"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"芸能人なら宮崎あおいさん。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ひめたんもあんな風になりたいなっていっつも思ってる!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"笑顔が可愛らしくて憧れます。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"でもかっこいい時のきりっとした表情も素敵ですね(`・ω・')"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"じゃ今日のしつもーん"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"何月生まれでーすか?"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ひめたんと同じ４月は何人おるんかなー。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"楽しみね♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/06/01/7792998/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ひめたんってツインテール以外に好きな髪型ってある?"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ポニーテール好きだよ＼(^O^)／"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"最近しとらんけど、ポニーテールもよくやってたかな!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"但し自力じゃできんけ、ままがおる時限定☆"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/06/01/7792998/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ひめたんってお団子出来ない?"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"こんどいつかやってみよかー(^ω^)?"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"っても、凝ったお団子はできなくて。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"くるくるきゅっきゅって感じのお団子でいいんならいつか♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/06/01/7792998/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ひめたんは夏が似合うイメージだけど(花に例えると向日葵かな)夏は好き?"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"なつ好きよーっ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"海行ってお祭り行って、わちゃわちゃするのすーき(*^^*)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ただねー、虫がうろうろしとるのが気にくわんよね..."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/06/01/7792998/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ひめたんはすーちゃんと会ったりするの?????"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"毎日あっとるよー?"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"一緒に住んでるんだもんっ!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/06/01/7792998/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ひめたんはキャッチフレーズ決まったんですか?"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"やっぱキャッチフレーズてなきゃだめー(>_<)?"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"どうしよ。なんかいいのないですかー?"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"思いついたら教えてねっ♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"(*´・ω・*)ひめたん"}],"source":"archive"}